  "content": "<br>\n\n<center>\n\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/logo/logo.png\" width=\"100%\" alt=\"朋友與敵人 - 花漾哞菇\" title=\"朋友與敵人 - 花漾哞菇\">\n</center>\n\n<br>\n\n<center>\n\t<a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/faboslav\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=請我喝杯咖啡&color=5b9c51&labelColor=5b9c51&logoColor=ffffff&style=for-the-badge&logo=ko-fi\" alt=\"請我喝杯咖啡\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Faboslav\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=成為贊助者&color=5b9c51&labelColor=5b9c51&logoColor=ffffff&style=for-the-badge&logo=patreon\" alt=\"成為贊助者\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://discord.gg/QGwFvvMQCn\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/924964658169913404?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=ffffff&label=加入我們的 Discord&labelColor=5b9c51&color=5b9c51\" alt=\"加入我們的 Discord\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Moobloom\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Wiki&logoColor=ffffff&style=for-the-badge&logo=github&labelColor=5b9c51&color=5b9c51\" alt=\"Wiki\">\n\t</a>\n</center>\n\n<br>\n\n<p>\n\t<span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">朋友與敵人 - 花漾哞菇（Friends&Foes - Flowery Mooblooms）是「朋友與敵人」模組的一個小型附加組件，為每種花朵添加了一種哞菇變種。花漾哞菇可以在草地和繁花森林生態域中找到。您可以查閱<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Moobloom\">Wiki</a>以獲取更多關於花漾哞菇的資訊。</span>\n</p>\n\t\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>🐮 花漾哞菇變種</h1>\n\n<table>\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>紫紅球花</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>藍花美耳草</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_allium.png\" width=\"133\" alt=\"紫紅球花哞菇\" title=\"紫紅球花哞菇\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_azure_bluet.png\" width=\"146\" alt=\"藍花美耳草哞菇\" title=\"藍花美耳草哞菇\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>藍色 orchid</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>矢車菊</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_blue_orchid.png\" width=\"149\" alt=\"藍色 orchid 哞菇\" title=\"藍色 orchid 哞菇\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_cornflower.png\" width=\"139\" alt=\"矢車菊哞菇\" title=\"矢車菊哞菇\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>蒲公英</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>丁香</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_dandelion.png\" width=\"149\" alt=\"蒲公英哞菇\" title=\"蒲公英哞菇\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_lilac.png\" width=\"144\" alt=\"丁香哞菇\" title=\"丁香哞菇\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>鈴蘭</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>橙色鬱金香</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_lily_of_the_valley.png\" width=\"140\" alt=\"鈴蘭哞菇\" title=\"鈴蘭哞菇\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_orange_tulip.png\" width=\"137\" alt=\"橙色鬱金香哞菇\" title=\"橙色鬱金香哞菇\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>雛菊</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>牡丹</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_oxeye_daisy.png\" width=\"134\" alt=\"雛菊哞菇\" title=\"雛菊哞菇\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_peony.png\" width=\"150\" alt=\"牡丹哞菇\" title=\"牡丹哞菇\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>粉紅色鬱金香</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>罌粟</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_pink_tulip.png\" width=\"137\" alt=\"粉紅色鬱金香哞菇\" title=\"粉紅色鬱金香哞菇\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_poppy.png\" width=\"142\" alt=\"罌粟哞菇\" title=\"罌粟哞菇\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>紅色鬱金香</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>玫瑰叢</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_red_tulip.png\" width=\"137\" alt=\"紅色鬱金香哞菇\" title=\"紅色鬱金香哞菇\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_rose_bush.png\" width=\"142\" alt=\"玫瑰叢哞菇\" title=\"玫瑰叢哞菇\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>向日葵</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>白色鬱金香</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_sunflower.png\" width=\"150\" alt=\"向日葵哞菇\" title=\"向日葵哞菇\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_white_tulip.png\" width=\"137\" alt=\"白色鬱金香哞菇\" title=\"白色鬱金香哞菇\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<br>\n\n<h1>⚙️ 其他附加組件 / 相容資料包</h1>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><a style=\"font-size: 18px;\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/friends-and-foes-beekeeper-hut-fabric\">朋友與敵人 - 養蜂人小屋</a></li>\t\n\t<li><a style=\"font-size: 18px;\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/repurposed-structures-friends-and-foes-datapack\">重構結構 - 朋友與敵人相容資料包</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n<br>\n\n<h1>💬 社群</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t歡迎<a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://discord.gg/QGwFvvMQCn\">加入我們的 Discord 伺服器社群</a>聊天、分享您的創作、提出任何問題，或只是想隨時了解模組的最新開發進度，並在新版本發布時收到通知。另外，也請別猶豫<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/issues\">透過 GitHub issues 回報任何崩潰或錯誤</a>。\n</p>\n\n<br>\n\n<h2>👋 支持</h2>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">無論有沒有支持，我都會繼續開發我的模組，因為這是我的興趣。儘管如此，我大部分的空閒時間都投入到模組開發中。所以，如果您仍想支持我，可以透過<a style=\"font-size: 18px;\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Faboslav\">Patreon</a>或<a style=\"font-size: 18px;\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/faboslav\">Ko-fi</a>。話雖如此，我衷心感謝大家的所有支持。</span></p>\n\n<br>\n\n<h1>📜 許可證</h1>\n\n<p>\n\t<span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">本模組採用<a style=\"font-size: 18px;\" href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/LICENSE.txt\">CC BY-NC-ND 4.0</a>許可證。</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n\t<span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">歡迎查閱我的程式碼，以了解我在編寫此模組時如何實現和解決各種問題，並將程式碼片段嵌入到您自己的程式碼中。也歡迎在任何模組包中使用此模組（若能標明出處並連結回此頁面，將不勝感激）。</span>\n</p>",
